    "reference": "The capitals of the US have included Annapolis (1694), Hartford (1875), Indianapolis (1825), Juneau (1906), and Honolulu (1845). Some state capitals have changed over time, such as Baton Rouge, which became the capital in 1880, and Des Moines in 1857. Dover has been the longest-serving capital in terms of statehood."
